# INVWINSY.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PANE0.CFG (TEST/WIN/PANE0.CFG, WINPANE.LOC=0): the location tree
# without its pane.  Locations > Browse locations shows the tree alone,
# its Record menu without Next pane; an arrow moves it, nothing
# following, and the frame maximized and restored keeps the location
# selected; F6, TAB and their SHIFT forms do nothing.  ENTER opens the
# selected location's contents as a screen of their own, and ESC comes
# back to the tree alone, that location selected.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSY.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/splitchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
K DOWN
S A1
K ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
S RESTORE
K F6 TAB SHIFT-F6 SHIFT-TAB
S KEYS
K ENTER
S FULL
K ESC
S BACK
K ALT-F X
